#: title/pc5_ui.c:8382
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Scan the code with your phone, or open %s in a browser on a PC on the same "
"network."
msgstr "用手機掃描QR碼，或在同一網路中的電腦上用瀏覽器開啟%s。"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:8385
msgid ""
